<Information title="About" description="Software development and product consulting from Optimum Tech.">
  <p>Optimum Tech helps businesses decide what to build, develop the software, and put it to work. Our work draws on experience building our own products and delivering client projects.</p>
  <p>Clients work with <a href="https://almirsarajcic.com/">Almir Sarajčić</a> through Optimum Tech. He uses coding agents to deliver software and takes responsibility for technical decisions, verification and the final result.</p>
  <p>Bring an Elixir or Phoenix feature you need delivered, a development workflow that slows your team down, or a coding-agent workflow that keeps getting in the way. We agree on a concrete outcome, what is included, the checks that show it works and a usable handoff. Product shaping, AI features and help adopting our products can fit within an agreed project.</p>
  <p>From 2022 to January 2026, we operated as Optimum BH, an Elixir and Phoenix agency. Optimum Tech continues with products and consulting.</p>
  <p><a href="/#consulting">Explore consulting</a>, <a href="/#work">see our products and tools</a> or <a href="mailto:consulting@optimum.ba">tell us what you’re building</a>.</p>
